---
onetaskgraph_template: 1
description: A task this host dispatches, in the layout every plan task here carries.
variables:
  what:
    description: >-
      The change, stated concretely enough that the worker can act on it without guessing:
      what to build or alter, where, and what it must not touch.
    type: text
    required: true
  why:
    description: >-
      The user's motivation for the change, in the user's own terms: what the worker and
      its judge weigh a trade-off against.
    type: text
    required: true
  additional_info:
    description: >-
      The task's own notes and grants, rendered under `## Additional info` above this host's
      operational notes: context the worker needs that is not a criterion, and any carve-out
      the operational notes say only a task may grant. Leave empty when there is none.
    type: text
    default: ""
---
{% extends "onepipeline/plan-task.md.j2" %}
{% block before_criteria %}
## What

{{ what }}

## Why

{{ why }}

{% endblock %}
{% block after_criteria %}
{% if additional_info %}

## Additional info

{{ additional_info }}
{% endif %}

